  "_what": "Measured live from the VaultCache pack MedievalGame_5.3, MESHES ONLY -- materials and textures were not migrated. Bounds and triangle counts are intrinsic to the mesh and unaffected by a missing material, which is why a 5 MB mesh-only probe answers the dimensional question that the ~800 MB of textures is not needed for.",
